/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135793136,imgsize-910437.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['No long speeches': Rahul Gandhi renews debate challenge to PM Modi with a 'guarantee']]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-long-speeches-rahul-gandhi-renews-debate-challenge-to-pm-modi-with-a-guarantee/articleshow/135792203.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135792203.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Rahul Gandhi has renewed his challenge for a public debate with Prime Minister Narendra Modi during an Instagram session. He claimed he was unable to speak freely in Parliament and called for direct allegations against each other. Gandhi suggested a debate moderated by a neutral party, including options like RSS chief Mohan Bhagwat. BJP leaders dismissed his calls, emphasizing that Parliament serves as an appropriate platform for discussions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-long-speeches-rahul-gandhi-renews-debate-challenge-to-pm-modi-with-a-guarantee/articleshow/135792203.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-long-speeches-rahul-gandhi-renews-debate-challenge-to-pm-modi-with-a-guarantee/articleshow/135792203.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-13T12:15:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135792825,imgsize-856882.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Army vehicle carrying 14 personnel hits tree after losing control; 8 jawans injured]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/hyderabad-8-army-personnel-injured-after-truck-crashes-into-roadside-tree/articleshow/135792327.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="mar