th-alleged-chinese-links-caught-at-sonauli-border-after-failing-to-speak-hindi/articleshow/135791009.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135791009.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indonesian-woman-with-alleged-chinese-links-caught-at-sonauli-border-after-failing-to-speak-hindi/articleshow/135791009.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indonesian-woman-with-alleged-chinese-links-caught-at-sonauli-border-after-failing-to-speak-hindi/articleshow/135791009.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-13T11:16:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Arvind Chauhan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135791343,imgsize-58331.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Delhi govt alleges plot to dump dead fish in Yamuna ahead of Chhath Puja, seeks FIR]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/delhi-govt-alleges-plot-to-dump-dead-fish-in-yamuna-ahead-of-chhath-puja-seeks-fir/articleshow/135790914.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135790914.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/delhi-govt-alleges-plot-to-dump-dead-fish-in-yamuna-ahead-of-chhath-puja-seeks-fir/articleshow/135790914.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/delhi-govt-alleges-plot-to-dump-dead-fish-in-yamuna-ahead-of-chhath-puja-seeks-fir/articleshow/135790914.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-13T11:01:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135790992,imgsize-1633128.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Railways looking into eliminating RAC for train journey]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/railways-looking-into-eliminating-rac-for-train-journey/articleshow/135790757.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135790757.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Railways is reviewing the Reservation Against Cancellation (RAC) facility due to passenger discomfort during travel. The existing system charges full fares for shared berths, raising concerns about fairness. Issues arise, particularly when male and female passengers share the same berth space, leading to uncomfortable situations. A parliamentary panel has also recommended the review of this arrangement for better passenger experience.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/railways-looking-into-eliminating-rac-for-train-journey/articleshow/135790757.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/railways-looking-into-eliminating-rac-for-train-journey/articleshow/135790757.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-13T10:57:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Dipak K Dash</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135790906,imgsize-126574.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Centre extends ban on Zakir Naik's Islamic Research Foundation for 5 years]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/centre-extends-ban-on-zakir-naiks-islamic-research-foundation-for-5-years/articleshow/135790746.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135790746.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/centre-extends-ban-on-zakir-naiks-islamic-research-foundation-for-5-years/articleshow/135790746.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/centre-extends-ban-on-zakir-naiks-islamic-research-foundation-for-5-years/articleshow/135790746.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-13T10:54:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135790781,imgsize-47840.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['We have given up violence': Former Maoist leader Deoji seeks ban on CPI (Maoist) lifted, eyes democratic politics]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/we-have-given-up-violence-former-maoist-leader-deoji-seeks-ban-on-cpimaoist-lifted-eyes-democratic-politics/articleshow/135789075.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135789075.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/we-have-given-up-violence-former-maoist-leader-deoji-seeks-ban-on-cpimaoist-lifted-eyes-democratic-politics/articleshow/135789075.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/we-have-given-up-violence-former-maoist-leader-deoji-seeks-ban-on-cpimaoist-lifted-eyes-democratic-politics/articleshow/135789075.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-13T09:53:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Bharti Jain</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135789244,imgsize-94682.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['From armed struggle to people's politics': Ex-Maoist leader Deoji outlines new path, seeks release of jailed cadres]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/from-armed-struggle-to-peoples-politics-ex-maoist-leader-deoji-outlines-new-path-seeks-release-of-jailed-cadres/articleshow/135789048.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135789048.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Former CPI(Maoist) leader Deoji is pivoting towards engaging in democratic politics, discarding his previous reliance on armed struggle. Now pursuing a law degree in Hyderabad, he is vocal about the need to remove the ban on CPI(Maoist) and seeks broad amnesty for Maoists in custody. He asserts that counter-Naxal initiatives have harmed their cause and expresses a vision for a society characterized by equity and freedom from exploitation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/from-armed-struggle-to-peoples-politics-ex-maoist-leader-deoji-outlines-new-path-seeks-release-of-jailed-cadres/articleshow/135789048.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/from-armed-struggle-to-peoples-politics-ex-maoist-leader-deoji-outlines-new-path-seeks-release-of-jailed-cadres/articleshow/135789048.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-13T09:53:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Bharti Jain</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135789241,imgsize-39606.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[India makes gains against TB, deaths down 38% since 2015: Centre]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-makes-gains-against-tb-deaths-down-38-since-2015-centre/articleshow/135787287.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135787287.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[India's estimated TB deaths declined by 38% between 2015 and 2025, signaling significant progress in controlling the disease. The treatment success rate for drug-susceptible TB reached 94%, supported by innovative diagnostic methods and comprehensive patient care. The ongoing TB Mukt Bharat Abhiyaan effectively identified nearly 15 lakh asymptomatic TB cases throughout the campaign. Despite progress, drug-resistant TB remains a challenge, with a notable treatment gap.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-makes-gains-against-tb-deaths-down-38-since-2015-centre/articleshow/135787287.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-makes-gains-against-tb-deaths-down-38-since-2015-centre/articleshow/135787287.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-13T08:35:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135787402,imgsize-56348.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rs 81 lakh property of PoK terror handler seized in J&amp;K's Rajouri]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rs-81-lakh-property-of-pok-terror-handler-seized-in-jks-rajouri/articleshow/135787209.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135787209.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rs-81-lakh-property-of-pok-terror-handler-seized-in-jks-rajouri/articleshow/135787209.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rs-81-lakh-property-of-pok-terror-handler-seized-in-jks-rajouri/articleshow/135787209.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-13T08:32:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135787284,imgsize-1740763.cms"/></item></channel></rss>